    "innovation": "Using a bespoke integrated assessment model, this paper demonstrates that to 2050, development choices will have a similar or stronger influence on livelihoods and economic wellbeing in rural coastal Bangladesh than climate-driven environmental change, challenging the climate-dominant narrative for the region.",
