            "target_entity_instance": "Bangladesh",
            "target_entity_type": "Country",
            "paragraph": "Our bespoke integrated assessment model (IAM) simulates these changes for rural areas by coupling physical models with economic models, considering shocks like cyclone landfalls, and utilising substantial primary/secondary datasets and stakeholder-derived future scenarios. As such, this study assesses the Bangladesh coastal system's sensitivity to climate change and policy decisions to 2050.",
