            "target_entity_instance": "Bangladesh",
            "target_entity_type": "Country",
            "paragraph": "The IAM results sug-gest that flooding and salinisation have high sensitivity to climatic and environmental drivers, and agricultural productivity is strongly dependent on farming methods and investment in better crop varieties to counteract these changes. Inequality, poverty and GDP per capita are more sensitive to non-climatic drivers.",
